  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting humanitarian assistance in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The humanitarian situation in Afghanistan is characterized by structural and systemic challenges, including significant gender inequality, a constrained rights environment, inadequate essential services, a struggling economy, prolonged food insecurity, and frequent natural disasters and climatic shocks. Through this project, IOM ensures a comprehensive and data-driven response for vulnerable migrants in Afghanistan through addressing humanitarian, protection and health needs of undocumented returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
